<title>UK: LME ALUMINIUM CHALKS UP NEW HIGH IN PM RING.</title>
<headline>LME ALUMINIUM CHALKS UP NEW HIGH IN PM RING.</headline>
<text>
<p>ALUMINIUM - Scores new 22-month high at $1,775 in afternoon ring.</p>
<p>Cash/threes backwardation flares to $20/$24.</p>
<p>ZINC - Firm, off highs. Spreads steady.</p>
<p>COPPER - Surges, breaks through $2,320 resistance.</p>
<p>TIN - Slightly higher, within range.</p>
<p>NICKEL - Holds above $7,200. LEAD - Maintains firmer stance.</p>
</text>
